# MISRA C++ 2023 default suite from CodeQL Coding Standards, minus RULE-8-7-1.
#
# cpp/misra/pointer-arithmetic-forms-an-invalid-pointer did not terminate on VisionPilot
# (Coding Standards v2.62.0 / CodeQL CLI 2.21.4: >35M iterations, ~70 min, no convergence).
# Its sister query for Rule 8.7.1 (pointer-argument-to-cstring-function-is-invalid) is kept.
# Remove the last exclude block to retry it on a newer release.
- description: MISRA C++ 2023 (Default) without the RULE-8-7-1 pointer arithmetic query
- qlpack: codeql/misra-cpp-coding-standards
- include:
    kind:
      - problem
      - path-problem
- exclude:
    tags contain:
      - external/misra/audit
      - external/misra/default-disabled
- exclude:
    id: cpp/misra/pointer-arithmetic-forms-an-invalid-pointer
